+# Security Fix: CVE-2026-111497
+
+**Package**: pyarrow 23.0.1
+**CVE**: CVE-2026-111497
+
+## Vulnerability
+
+Out-of-bounds write in the Google Brotli decoder (`c/dec/decode.c` and
+`c/include/brotli/decode.h`), versions 1.0.3 through 1.2.0. pyarrow 23.0.1
+statically links the Brotli v1.0.9 that Apache Arrow bundles. Those sources
+are not in the PyPI sdist.
+
+## Fix
+
+`build/build.sh` clones apache-arrow-23.0.1, applies
+`build/brotli-v1.0.9-CVE-2026-111497.patch` to `c/dec/decode.c` and
+`c/include/brotli/decode.h`, and configures libarrow only after that.
+The wheel must contain the patched decoder string `BLOCK_SWITCH`.
+
+This file is a marker so patch-source has a diff to apply. It does not
+change the decoder, and a nested patch file in the sdist is not the fix.
+
